  "label": "anti-immigrant sentiment audience",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who hold or are influenced by anti-immigrant sentiment, xenophobic attitudes, and who may be receptive to the false dichotomy that equates all immigrants with 'illegal aliens'. This audience is likely to be politically or culturally aligned with narratives that portray immigrants as a threat to national identity, security, or economic stability, and who may support restrictive immigration policies. The meme is designed to reinforce these prejudiced views by visually contrasting 'immigrants' (as lawful, patriotic citizens) with 'illegal aliens' (as unauthorized, dangerous, and undesirable), thereby appealing to those who fear or distrust immigration.",
